I actually like this direction better for **Pulse MVP** because the product will evolve rapidly. MongoDB gives us flexibility to support **construction first → all field industries later** without constantly redesigning the database.

The important thing is we should design it as a **multi-tenant SaaS from day one** (many companies using one platform), because that is what turns it from a project into a real startup architecture.
